{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>נבלעם — ותמימים</b>: They will be swallowed like those who descend into the pit. Another interpretation: all of them whole, Sheol — he explained below. Sometimes in masculine form: ערום שאול. And sometimes in feminine form: שאול מתחת רגזה לך."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "The comment juxtaposes two phrase-lemmas from adjacent verse segments (נבלעם from v. 12 and ותמימים from v. 11); the verse citations for the two quoted phrases at the end are implied but not stated by Ibn Ezra."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:45.921805862Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}